624
00:45:07,250 --> 00:45:10,083
- Belum.
- Apa? Belum?

625
00:45:10,833 --> 00:45:12,875
Oh! Ya Tuhan!

626
00:45:12,958 --> 00:45:16,041
Di sini dingin,
tapi kau belum merasa dingin?

627
00:45:16,125 --> 00:45:19,250
Peddi, berbahaya jika panasmu tak turun.

628
00:45:19,333 --> 00:45:24,333
Dia meledak seperti gunung berapi.
Lihat wajahnya merah?

629
00:45:24,416 --> 00:45:27,666
- Hei! Kenapa dua pompa?
- Kami mendinginkan diri.

630
00:45:27,750 --> 00:45:28,791
Sangat menyengat.

631
00:45:28,875 --> 00:45:32,541
Achiyamma mengadakan pesta di rumahnya.

632
00:45:32,625 --> 00:45:34,708
Pesta? Pasti ada daging.

633
00:45:34,791 --> 00:45:37,583
Ayo.
Achiyamma adalah pesta bagiku.

634
00:45:37,666 --> 00:45:39,958
- Angkat itu.
- Ayo, angkat.

635
00:45:41,208 --> 00:45:42,791
Ayo, kawan.

636
00:45:42,875 --> 00:45:46,041
Peddi terbakar sejak melihat Achiyamma.

637
00:45:46,500 --> 00:45:49,166
Tuhan, aku bisa merasakan panasnya.
Hati-hati.

638
00:45:49,250 --> 00:45:51,333
Lompat.

639
