cinta membuat Peddi suaminya.

1926
02:29:06,250 --> 02:29:10,333
<i>Dalam hatinya,
Peddi sudah jadi suaminya.</i>

1927
02:29:12,208 --> 02:29:15,291
<i>♪ I stand at the roadside ♪</i>

1928
02:29:15,625 --> 02:29:21,625
<i>♪ Watching with waiting eyes ♪</i>

1929
02:29:26,250 --> 02:29:29,458
<i>Hari itu, dia tahu Menteri
Perkeretaapian baru</i>

1930
02:29:29,541 --> 02:29:32,208
<i>sedang mengunjungi Rail Bhawan.</i>

1931
02:29:32,291 --> 02:29:35,750
<i>Dia pergi ke sana berharap menteri
bisa menyelesaikan masalah desa kami.</i>

1932
02:29:35,833 --> 02:29:37,250
Tuan! Tuan!

1933
02:29:38,208 --> 02:29:39,083
Tuan!

1934
02:29:39,416 --> 02:29:42,125
<i>♪ I will listen from all directions ♪</i>

1935
02:29:42,291 --> 02:29:44,875
Tolong, aku harus menemui menteri!

1936
02:29:45,333 --> 02:29:50,666
<i>♪ You must rise even with broken wings ♪</i>

1937
02:29:50,750 --> 02:29:56,208
<i>♪ Who can stop a soul
Reaching for the sun? ♪</i>

1938
02:29:56,291 --> 02:30:01,583
<i>♪ Let the country hear the anguish ♪</i>

1939
02:30:01,666 --> 02:30:05,916
<i>♪ Of countless hearts through your voice ♪</i>

1940
02:30:07,791 --> 02:30:12,958
<i>♪ Don’t stop your journey
Don’t leave your patience behind ♪</i>

1941
02:30:13,500 --> 02:30:18,791
<i>♪ Rewrite the fate of this village... ♪</i>

1942
02:30:21,083 --> 02:30:22,250
Apa yang terjadi?

1943
02:30:22,333 --> 02:30:25,041
Ban belakang terangkat.
Mobilnya tidak bisa jalan.

1944
02:30:41,708 --> 02:30:43,791
Hei, tinggalkan dia.
Pergi sana.

1945
02:30:51,625 --> 02:30:54,750
Tuan, maafkan aku.
Tak ada cara lain untuk menemuimu.

1946
02:30:54,875 --> 02:30:55,958
Ada masalah apa?

1947
02:30:56,041 --> 02:30:58,583
Tentang desaku, Tuan.
Stasiun kereta.

1948
02:30:58,666 --> 02:31:00,291
Kami butuh itu, Tuan.

1949
02:31:00,375 --> 02:31:02,791
- Nama desanya?
- Desa orang dataran rendah, Tuan.

1950
02:31:02,875 --> 02:31:05,041
- Apa?
- Tuan...

1951
02:31:05,125 --> 02:31:08,125
Desa kami tak punya nama, Tuan.
Kami tak punya identitas.

1952
02:31:08,458 --> 02:31:13,541
Aku menang semifinal gulat
nasional tiga tahun lalu.

1953
02:31:13,708 --> 02:31:15,333
- Ini.
- Hah?

1954
02:31:16,208 --> 02:31:17,583
Ini.

1955
02:31:18,416 --> 02:31:19,958
Aku seorang juara, Tuan.

1956
02:31:20,250 --> 02:31:21,541
Oh!

1957
02:31:23,916 --> 02:31:26,750
- Peraih medali perak, ya?
- Benar, Tuan.

1958
02:31:27,291 --> 02:31:29,375
Apa bedanya, Tuan?

1959
02:31:30,000 --> 02:31:32,125
Kau bilang kau tak punya identitas.

1960
02:31:33,208 --> 02:31:37,333
Pasti kau dapat sertifikat
setelah kalah di final.

1961
02:31:37,458 --> 02:31:39,083
Dan mendapat pekerjaan pemerintah juga.

1962
02:31:39,166 --> 02:31:41,166
Tuan...

1963
02:31:41,250 --> 02:31:43,125
Aku tidak kalah, Tuan.

1964
02:31:43,208 --> 02:31:46,958
Kakiku menyerah
sebelum aku bisa bertanding.

1965
02:31:47,291 --> 02:31:50,083
Aku tak bisa main di final,
tapi aku tidak pernah kalah, Tuan.

1966
02:31:50,666 --> 02:31:52,000
Tuan.

1967
02:31:52,083 --> 02:31:53,583
Alasan.

1968
02:31:54,375 --> 02:31:58,000
Itu cuma alasan
untuk menutupi kekalahanmu.

1969
02:31:58,916 --> 02:32:01,000
Hanya kemenangan yang berarti.

1970
02:32:02,458 --> 02:32:04,041
Tuan...

1971
02:32:05,750 --> 02:32:07,416
Peddi mengerti saat itu...

1972
02:32:07,750 --> 02:32:10,666
Bahwa suara kemenangannya
tak didengar pihak berwenang.

1973
02:33:04,625 --> 02:33:07,541
Jadi Peddi kembali ke Vizianagaram?

1974
02:35:16,666 --> 02:35:18,750
Ku... Kurumaiah!

1975
02:35:40,916 --> 02:35:44,833
<i>Saat itu,
atlet dalam diri Peddi hidup kembali.</i>

1976
02:35:46,750 --> 02:35:48,833
<i>Dia mungkin baru di olahraga ini,</i>

1977
02:35:48,916 --> 02:35:51,041
<i>tapi olahraga ini bukan hal
baru baginya, Tuan.</i>

1978
02:36:16,833 --> 02:36:19,250
Gangamma,
kau diberkati dengan seorang putra!

1979
02:36:24,791 --> 02:36:26,916
Oh tidak! Bayinya lahir tanpa kaki.

1980
02:36:33,000 --> 02:36:35,958
Tubuhnya terbentuk
dari bertahun-tahun mendaki bukit.

1981
02:36:36,041 --> 02:36:38,541
Dia beradaptasi dengan olahraga
apa pun dengan mudah.

1982
02:36:40,000 --> 02:36:43,125
Tahu olahraga apa yang dia pilih kali ini?

1983
02:36:43,208 --> 02:36:44,625
Lari.

1984
02:36:55,958 --> 02:36:58,041
Akan kuberitahu sekarang, Tuan!

1985
02:36:58,125 --> 02:36:59,750
Aku Kurumaiah.

1986
02:36:59,833 --> 02:37:02,458
Peddi juga pemain favoritku.

1987
02:37:13,000 --> 02:37:16,958
Bertanding itu sendiri
adalah pemberontakan Peddi.

1988
02:37:17,041 --> 02:37:20,708
Patung di belakangku
bukan patung pecundang.

1989
02:37:20,791 --> 02:37:23,083
Itu patung pria yang mengalahkan
kegagalan itu sendiri.

1990
02:37:30,166 --> 02:37:32,750
<i>Seumur hidup, kami berjalan
hanya untuk bekerja.</i>

1991
02:37:32,958 --> 02:37:35,666
<i>Tapi hari itu, kami berjalan
demi perjuangan seorang pria.</i>

1992
02:37:36,000 --> 02:37:38,083
<i>Semua orang dari desa kami</i>

1993
02:37:38,375 --> 02:37:41,000
<i>datang ke Vizianagaram
untuk mendukung Peddi.</i>

1994
02:37:41,083 --> 02:37:44,000
Peddi dari desa
kami sedang bertanding, Tuan.

1995
02:37:44,375 --> 02:37:46,666
Kami ke sini berharap
Anda menayangkannya di TV.

1996
02:37:49,416 --> 02:37:53,291
<i>Panggung sudah siap
untuk Delhi Para Asian Games 1996.</i>

1997
02:37:53,750 --> 02:37:56,041
<i>Dan semua mata tertuju pada final ini.</i>

1998
02:37:57,000 --> 02:38:00,916
<i>Delapan atlet,
masing-masing dengan cerita dan mimpi,</i>

1999
02:38:01,000 --> 02:38:04,333
<i>bertanding dalam lomba 400
meter yang mendebarkan ini.</i>

2000
02:38:05,000 --> 02:38:06,541
Duduklah di sampingku.

2001
02:38:06,625 --> 02:38:07,666
Tontonlah.

2002
02:38:45,541 --> 02:38:47,833
<i>Para atlet sedang menyesuaikan posisi.</i>

2003
02:38:47,916 --> 02:38:49,875
<i>Fokus, setiap gerakan terukur.</i>

2004
02:38:49,958 --> 02:38:51,916
<i>Ketenangan sebelum badai!</i>

2005
02:38:52,000 --> 02:38:53,541
<i>Peddi di lintasan empat!</i>

2006
02:38:53,625 --> 02:38:57,291
<i>Orang India pertama di final 400 meter.</i>

2007
02:38:57,375 --> 02:38:59,875
<i>Dukungan penonton tuan
rumah di belakangnya.</i>

2008
02:38:59,958 --> 02:39:06,375
<i>Tapi dia harus bersaing dengan pelari
hebat dari China, Pakistan, dan Sri Lanka.</i>

2009
02:39:06,458 --> 02:39:08,541
Bersedia!

2010
02:40:18,791 --> 02:40:20,833
<i>Hamza dari Pakistan mulai memimpin.</i>

2011
02:40:20,916 --> 02:40:22,166
<i>Cepat dan efisien,</i>

2012
02:40:22,250 --> 02:40:24,333
<i>meninggalkan rombongan.</i>

2013
02:40:36,041 --> 02:40:37,250
<i>Baik kelahiran maupun kematian</i>

2014
02:40:37,333 --> 02:40:39,041
<i>seharusnya diakui pemerintah.</i>

2015
02:40:39,125 --> 02:40:41,208
<i>Dasar mongrel lereng bukit yang kotor!</i>

2016
02:40:44,500 --> 02:40:47,333
<i>Tahu kenapa aku selalu menaikkan
tawaran satu rupee saja?</i>

2017
02:40:47,416 --> 02:40:49,500
<i>Satu rupee itu mencerminkan harga dirimu.</i>

2018
02:41:24,416 --> 02:41:25,625
<i>Oh! Peddi terjatuh.</i>

2019
02:41:25,708 --> 02:41:27,333
- <i>Dia tersandung tiba-tiba.</i>
- Peddi!

2020
02:41:27,416 --> 02:41:29,750
<i>Perlombaan berubah tak terduga.</i>

2021
02:41:29,833 --> 02:41:31,916
<i>Penonton terkejut!</i>

2022
02:42:09,500 --> 02:42:11,666
<i>Mati seperti ini tidaklah salah...</i>

2023
02:42:11,750 --> 02:42:14,041
<i>Tapi salah untuk hidup seperti ini, Peddi!</i>

2024
02:42:14,500 --> 02:42:17,333
<i>Jika kereta itu berhenti di rel ini,</i>

2025
02:42:18,291 --> 02:42:21,041
<i>kita akhirnya punya identitas, Peddi!</i>

2026
02:42:22,166 --> 02:42:24,250
<i>Kemenangan menentukan segalanya.</i>

2027
02:42:25,000 --> 02:42:27,083
<i>Hanya kemenangan!</i>

2028
02:42:43,333 --> 02:42:45,125
Peddi sudah berdiri lagi!

2029
02:42:45,208 --> 02:42:47,541
<i>Tugas yang sangat mustahil di depannya.</i>

2030
02:43:28,666 --> 02:43:31,375
<i>Setiap langkah berarti,
setiap detik penting!</i>

2031
02:43:31,458 --> 02:43:33,083
<i>Ini perjuangan melawan waktu!</i>

2032
02:43:33,166 --> 02:43:35,583
<i>Apa Peddi bisa menjaga kecepatan ini?</i>

2033
02:43:36,208 --> 02:43:38,875
<i>Peddi mengejar jarak langkah demi langkah!</i>

2034
02:43:38,958 --> 02:43:41,833
<i>Lima meter, dia menyusul rombongan depan!</i>

2035
02:43:41,916 --> 02:43:44,375
<i>Sangat ketat, bahu-membahu!</i>

2036
02:43:44,458 --> 02:43:47,250
<i>Mereka semua mengerahkan sisa tenaga.</i>

2037
02:43:58,041 --> 02:43:59,458
<i>Ya Tuhan!</i>

2038
02:43:59,541 --> 02:44:02,250
<i>Empat atlet mencapai garis bersamaan!</i>

2039
02:44:02,333 --> 02:44:04,083
<i>Mustahil untuk dipastikan!</i>

2040
02:44:04,166 --> 02:44:06,666
<i>Wasit memberi isyarat foto finis.</i>

2041
02:44:06,750 --> 02:44:09,708
<i>Tak ada yang bisa melihat
siapa pemenangnya.</i>

2042
02:44:09,791 --> 02:44:11,250
<i>Mari lihat tayangan ulangnya!</i>

2043
02:44:11,333 --> 02:44:13,666
<i>100 meter terakhir dalam gerak lambat.</i>

2044
02:44:15,750 --> 02:44:18,791
<i>Finis yang sangat tipis.
Sulit terlihat.</i>

2045
02:44:18,875 --> 02:44:21,375
<i>Semua menunggu pengumuman pemenang.</i>

2046
02:44:22,041 --> 02:44:23,708
<i>Inilah gambar henti-nya.</i>

2047
02:44:23,791 --> 02:44:26,291
<i>Saat penentuan! Siapa yang menang?</i>

2048
02:44:26,375 --> 02:44:28,750
<i>Peddi!
Peddi raih emas untuk India</i>

2049
02:44:28,958 --> 02:44:30,791
<i>dengan selisih sepersekian detik!</i>

2050
02:44:30,875 --> 02:44:32,375
<i>Setelah terjatuh!</i>

2051
02:44:32,458 --> 02:44:35,791
<i>Dari posisi belakang!
Menang foto finis.</i>

2052
02:44:35,875 --> 02:44:38,500
<i>Ini kebangkitan terbaik yang pernah ada.</i>

2053
02:44:48,708 --> 02:44:50,541
Peddi! Peddi!

2054
02:44:50,625 --> 02:44:54,958
<i>Untuk pertama kalinya,
Peddi raih emas!</i>

2055
02:44:55,041 --> 02:44:56,291
<i>Pahlawan yang luar biasa!</i>

2056
02:44:56,375 --> 02:44:57,625
<i>Lomba yang hebat!</i>

2057
02:44:57,708 --> 02:45:00,041
<i>Momen luar biasa bagi atletik India!</i>

2058
02:45:42,583 --> 02:45:44,250
Kau adalah kebanggaan India!

2059
02:45:50,041 --> 02:45:51,291
Aku tak ingin ini, Tuan.

2060
02:46:07,833 --> 02:46:09,916
Aku ingin itu, Tuan.

2061
02:47:11,583 --> 02:47:13,666
Peddi ini...

2062
02:47:14,083 --> 02:47:16,375
Bukan orang India, Tuan!

2063
02:47:16,458 --> 02:47:18,375
Apa?

2064
02:47:19,166 --> 02:47:20,291
Dia bukan orang India?

2065
02:47:20,375 --> 02:47:21,833
Kau bukan orang India?

2066
02:47:28,666 --> 02:47:30,916
Tuan Peddi, kau dari Andhra Pradesh!

2067
02:47:31,875 --> 02:47:33,916
Distrik Vizianagaram, Mandal Salur.

2068
02:47:34,000 --> 02:47:36,083
Profilmu benar. Kau orang India!

2069
02:47:38,166 --> 02:47:40,291
Jika aku menyebut diriku orang India,

2070
02:47:40,750 --> 02:47:43,875
bukankah desaku harus bagian dari India?

2071
02:47:54,791 --> 02:47:57,333
Meski tak bisa jalan,
aku lari sejauh ini...

2072
02:47:58,958 --> 02:48:02,083
Bukan untuk pamer kalau aku bisa lari.

2073
02:48:03,750 --> 02:48:07,958
Tapi untuk tunjukkan warga desa
masih harus berjalan bermil-mil.

2074
02:48:15,458 --> 02:48:17,541
Tanpa berjalan kaki,

2075
02:48:18,250 --> 02:48:20,750
tak ada cara lain ke desaku.

2076
02:48:25,333 --> 02:48:27,416
Jika kami tak bisa tinggal
di tempat lahir,

2077
02:48:28,208 --> 02:48:31,791
pemerintah hanya menyuruh kami pergi.

2078
02:48:35,041 --> 02:48:37,125
Jika pindah adalah solusinya,

2079
02:48:38,250 --> 02:48:40,333
bagaimana negara ini bisa maju, Tuan?

2080
02:48:42,750 --> 02:48:46,333
Pemerintah India bisa terbang tinggi,

2081
02:48:47,333 --> 02:48:50,791
tapi tak bisa menjangkau
desa kami sendiri.

2082
02:48:56,375 --> 02:48:58,458
Aku sadar setelah sampai di sini.

2083
02:48:59,541 --> 02:49:03,458
Ada 18.000 desa seperti kami,

2084
02:49:03,625 --> 02:49:05,916
tanpa nama dan tanpa identitas!

2085
02:49:18,166 --> 02:49:19,541
Harimau.

2086
02:49:19,625 --> 02:49:21,625
Hewan nasional.

2087
02:49:21,708 --> 02:49:22,916
Merak.

2088
02:49:23,000 --> 02:49:25,208
Burung nasional.

2089
02:49:25,291 --> 02:49:29,875
Identitas dan rasa hormat bagi mereka...

2090
02:49:30,291 --> 02:49:33,458
Kami warga desa tak punya itu, Tuan!

2091
02:49:36,208 --> 02:49:39,666
Bahkan yang mati di desa
kami tak punya identitas.

2092
02:49:43,000 --> 02:49:46,791
Saat mereka bertanya hubunganku
dengan jenazah Appala Suri...

2093
02:49:47,875 --> 02:49:50,625
Rasanya mereka tak hanya
mempertanyakan identitasnya.

2094
02:49:51,541 --> 02:49:55,583
Tapi merendahkan identitas
dan harga diri desa kami!

2095
02:50:01,791 --> 02:50:06,125
Katanya dulu, Inggris menghentikan
kereta di tempat tertentu

2096
02:50:06,666 --> 02:50:10,208
untuk buang air atau hiburan.

2097
02:50:10,458 --> 02:50:13,375
Begitulah stasiun kereta itu ada.

2098
02:50:15,375 --> 02:50:19,750
Apa darah kami tak lebih berharga
dari kencing mereka?

2099
02:50:22,625 --> 02:50:27,375
Jika kereta pemerintah berhenti
di desa kami semenit saja,

2100
02:50:28,000 --> 02:50:30,416
pejabat yang mengabaikan kami

2101
02:50:30,916 --> 02:50:35,708
pasti akan menyebut nama
desa kami tiap dia lewat.

2102
02:50:36,291 --> 02:50:38,375
Cukup keras agar seluruh bangsa dengar.

2103
02:50:38,833 --> 02:50:40,791
Saat itulah desa kami punya nama.

2104
02:50:40,875 --> 02:50:43,500
Salur jadi Mandal,
Vizianagaram jadi distrik,

2105
02:50:43,583 --> 02:50:45,625
dan Andhra Pradesh jadi negara bagian.

2106
02:50:45,708 --> 02:50:47,958
Barulah Peddi ini,

2107
02:50:48,041 --> 02:50:50,791
dari desa terpencil,
benar-benar jadi orang India.

2108
02:50:54,166 --> 02:50:56,625
Sebuah bangsa bersatu

2109
02:50:57,375 --> 02:50:59,458
hanya dalam dua situasi.

2110
02:50:59,875 --> 02:51:01,958
Saat kita berperang.

2111
02:51:02,791 --> 02:51:05,250
Saat kita bertanding untuk negara.

2112
02:51:05,916 --> 02:51:08,000
Kalian pikir aku hanya bermain.

2113
02:51:10,750 --> 02:51:12,833
Tapi aku berjuang, Tuan.

2114
02:51:25,708 --> 02:51:31,708
Beri identitas pada desa Peddi,
pria yang kau sebut India.

2115
02:51:34,708 --> 02:51:37,333
Identitas kami adalah harga diri kami.

2116
02:51:38,541 --> 02:51:41,083
Identitas kami adalah medali emasku.

2117
02:52:35,416 --> 02:52:38,083
<i>♪ Like an ancient legend ♪</i>

2118
02:52:38,166 --> 02:52:44,708
<i>♪ Your story will raise
Generations to come ♪</i>

2119
02:52:45,916 --> 02:52:50,416
<i>♪ Your name became a lullaby ♪</i>

2120
02:52:50,500 --> 02:52:55,541
<i>♪ In our mothers’ voices ♪</i>

2121
02:52:56,583 --> 02:52:59,250
<i>♪ Those train rides we dreamed of ♪</i>

2122
02:52:59,333 --> 02:53:05,625
<i>♪ Once felt beyond our reach ♪</i>

2123
02:53:07,083 --> 02:53:11,250
<i>♪ You freed us from roads of misery ♪</i>

2124
02:53:11,583 --> 02:53:14,916
<i>♪ And brought heaven to our huts ♪</i>

2125
02:53:15,000 --> 02:53:18,375
<i>Kereta yang mengejek kami
dengan klaksonnya bertahun-tahun,</i>

2126
02:53:18,708 --> 02:53:21,666
<i>akhirnya berhenti di depan
kami untuk pertama kali.</i>

2127
02:53:22,916 --> 02:53:27,375
<i>♪ A god without a temple
That’s what you are to us ♪</i>

2128
02:53:27,458 --> 02:53:33,041
<i>♪ We carry you forever
In the palanquin of our hearts ♪</i>

2129
02:53:35,333 --> 02:53:40,666
<i>♪ If we could bloom as flowers ♪</i>

2130
02:53:40,750 --> 02:53:46,083
<i>♪ We’d fall at your feet in worship ♪</i>

2131
02:53:46,833 --> 02:53:51,791
<i>♪ If we could flow like water ♪</i>

2132
02:53:51,875 --> 02:53:57,125
<i>♪ We’d wash your feet in devotion ♪</i>

2133
02:54:02,416 --> 02:54:04,500
Ada apa ini, Nak?

2134
02:54:07,166 --> 02:54:09,375
Apa, Bu?

2135
02:54:09,458 --> 02:54:11,541
Siapa yang tahu ada kehidupan setelah ini?

2136
02:54:18,625 --> 02:54:21,291
<i>♪ Like an ancient legend ♪</i>

2137
02:54:21,375 --> 02:54:28,041
<i>♪ Your story will raise
Generations to come ♪</i>

2138
02:54:29,166 --> 02:54:33,333
<i>♪ Your name became a lullaby ♪</i>

2139
02:54:33,791 --> 02:54:38,125
<i>♪ In our mothers’ voices ♪</i>

2140
02:54:38,750 --> 02:54:40,833
Peddi!

2141
02:54:41,791 --> 02:54:45,916
Untuk pertama kalinya
dalam sejarah Kereta Api India,

2142
02:54:46,250 --> 02:54:49,000
kereta khusus disiapkan
dari Delhi untuk satu pemain.

2143
02:54:49,333 --> 02:54:50,416
Bukan hanya itu.

2144
02:54:50,500 --> 02:54:54,041
Stasiun bernama "Peddi"
telah disetujui untuk desamu.

2145
02:54:57,500 --> 02:55:00,000
- Seharusnya jangan dinamai "Peddi," Tuan.
- Lalu?

2146
02:55:03,500 --> 02:55:07,166
Tolong beri nama Appalavalasa,
kenang Appala Suri.

2147
02:55:22,916 --> 02:55:25,666
<i>Hari saat kereta berhenti
untuk Peddi kami,</i>

2148
02:55:25,750 --> 02:55:27,833
<i>hidup kami benar-benar dimulai, Tuan.</i>

2149
02:55:40,958 --> 02:55:42,875
KANTOR KELURAHAN DESA

2150
02:55:48,791 --> 02:55:50,000
Pos!

2151
02:55:50,083 --> 02:55:52,291
<i>Menghargai harga diri desa kami,</i>

2152
02:55:52,375 --> 02:55:54,875
<i>pemerintah telah mengirim pos
dengan kode pos.</i>

2153
02:55:54,958 --> 02:55:57,041
<i>Kau tahu apa pos pertama itu?</i>

2154
02:56:07,041 --> 02:56:08,708
Tuan...

2155
02:56:10,250 --> 02:56:12,458
Ini bukan sekadar patung batu.

2156
02:56:13,125 --> 02:56:15,416
Ini harga diri desa kami.

2157
02:56:16,333 --> 02:56:17,541
Ayo, Tuan.

2158
02:56:17,625 --> 02:56:19,375
Temui Peddi.

2159
02:56:19,458 --> 02:56:21,541
Dia tak jauh dari sini.

2160
02:56:23,041 --> 02:56:24,916
Kami tak perlu menemuinya.

2161
02:56:25,000 --> 02:56:26,458
Mari kita kembali.

2162
02:56:27,333 --> 02:56:29,375
Kau mau kembali?

2163
02:56:29,458 --> 02:56:30,291
Kenapa, Tuan?

2164
02:56:30,375 --> 02:56:33,416
Sudah sampai sini,
kenapa pergi tanpa temui Peddi?

2165
02:56:37,416 --> 02:56:39,500
Aku malu, Kurumaiah.

2166
02:56:41,083 --> 02:56:45,375
Aku salah menilai pemain
hebat seperti Peddi.

2167
02:56:46,833 --> 02:56:51,541
Aku sadar kita harus hadapi masalah kita.

2168
02:56:56,541 --> 02:56:59,083
Dengan pemukul, Peddi hadapi masalahnya.

2169
02:56:59,916 --> 02:57:01,708
Lewat gulat, dia melawannya.

2170
02:57:01,791 --> 02:57:04,041
Dan dengan berlari, dia mengusir semuanya.

2171
02:57:04,458 --> 02:57:09,125
Dia memberi tujuan pada olahraga
dan mengubah pandangan orang.

2172
02:57:12,541 --> 02:57:14,416
Peddi memberitahuku

2173
02:57:14,500 --> 02:57:16,583
apa yang harus kulakukan mulai sekarang.

2174
02:57:17,833 --> 02:57:19,666
Kurumaiah!

2175
02:57:20,208 --> 02:57:21,666
Ayo pergi.

2176
02:57:25,750 --> 02:57:31,791
<i>Visakha Passenger dari Raipur
ke Visakhapatnam via Vizianagaram</i>

2177
02:57:31,875 --> 02:57:35,583
<i>akan berangkat dari peron
satu di Appalavalasa.</i>

2178
02:57:35,708 --> 02:57:37,791
Kau dengar itu, Tuan?

2179
02:57:38,250 --> 02:57:41,083
Appalavalasa.
Itu nama desa kami.

2180
02:57:41,625 --> 02:57:44,750
Itulah identitas yang Peddi bawa, Tuan.

2181
02:57:45,333 --> 02:57:46,833
- Ayah!
- Halo, sayang.

2182
02:57:46,916 --> 02:57:49,916
Kau pergi sejak pagi.
Kenapa lama sekali?

2183
02:57:50,000 --> 02:57:51,750
Aku bersamanya.

2184
02:57:51,833 --> 02:57:53,958
Dia putriku.
Dia sedang kuliah kedokteran.

2185
02:57:56,041 --> 02:57:57,583
- Semoga sukses.
- Terima kasih.

2186
02:57:57,666 --> 02:57:59,333
- Kurumaiah.
- Sampai jumpa, Tuan.

2187
02:58:00,791 --> 02:58:03,166
- Kuruma!
- Mau ke mana, Narsi?

2188
02:58:03,250 --> 02:58:04,583
Aku mau ke Vizianagaram.

2189
02:58:04,666 --> 02:58:06,750
- Hati-hati.
- Aku kembali dalam satu jam.

2190
02:58:18,708 --> 02:58:20,625
- Kurumaiah...
- Tuan.

2191
02:58:20,708 --> 02:58:22,958
Desamu akhirnya punya kereta.

2192
02:58:23,041 --> 02:58:26,416
Kenapa kau menyuruhku
jalan kaki sejauh ini?

2193
02:58:26,875 --> 02:58:29,125
Jika aku tak menyuruhmu jalan kaki,

2194
02:58:29,458 --> 02:58:32,041
kau takkan tahu betapa
kami butuh kereta itu.

2195
02:58:56,250 --> 02:58:59,125
Peddi!

2196
02:59:06,625 --> 02:59:08,083
<i>♪ You built thrones out of fear ♪</i>

2197
02:59:08,166 --> 02:59:10,791
<i>♪ Gold teeth glass crowns
Every promise you broke ♪</i>

2198
02:59:10,875 --> 02:59:12,291
<i>♪ Is a weight pulling you down ♪</i>

2199
02:59:12,375 --> 02:59:13,791
<i>Perjuangan petani,</i>

2200
02:59:13,875 --> 02:59:15,250
<i>pengorbanan tentara,</i>

2201
02:59:15,333 --> 02:59:16,750
<i>dan semangat atlet...</i>

2202
02:59:16,833 --> 02:59:18,916
<i>Adalah tulang punggung bangsa.</i>

2203
02:59:22,500 --> 02:59:24,583
Siapa yang tahu ada kehidupan setelah ini?

2204
02:59:26,083 --> 02:59:28,166
Katakan!

2205
02:59:35,250 --> 02:59:38,750
Mari luncurkan kampanye pedesaan terbesar.

2206
02:59:39,875 --> 02:59:42,625
Mari cari pemain dari pelosok.

2207
02:59:44,666 --> 02:59:46,750
Seorang politisi...

2208
02:59:47,250 --> 02:59:52,250
Pergi dari pintu ke pintu
untuk suara, kan?

2209
02:59:54,500 --> 02:59:56,625
Begitu juga, mari kita ke desa-desa

2210
02:59:57,083 --> 02:59:59,166
dan mencari pemain.

2211
03:00:00,500 --> 03:00:03,125
Kau menyarankan kita turun
ke tingkat desa?

2212
03:00:04,958 --> 03:00:07,583
Kita tak turun ke level mereka.

2213
03:00:08,958 --> 03:00:11,541
Kita bangkit ke level itu.

2214
03:00:11,833 --> 03:00:12,833
Ya!

2215
03:04:16,416 --> 03:04:18,375
<i>♪ You built thrones out of fear ♪</i>

2216
03:04:18,458 --> 03:04:21,125
<i>♪ Gold teeth glass crowns
Every promise you broke ♪</i>

2217
03:04:21,208 --> 03:04:23,625
<i>♪ Is a weight pulling you down ♪</i>

2218
03:04:27,416 --> 03:04:29,125
<i>♪ You talk like you own ♪</i>

2219
03:04:29,208 --> 03:04:30,583
<i>♪ Every breath in this town ♪</i>

2220
03:04:30,666 --> 03:04:33,750
<i>♪ But the cracks in your castle
Are screaming too loud ♪</i>

2221
03:04:38,500 --> 03:04:41,000
<i>♪ I'm the name that you never learned ♪</i>

2222
03:04:41,083 --> 03:04:43,875
<i>♪ Till it's written on your face ♪</i>

2223
03:04:43,958 --> 03:04:46,458
<i>♪ I'm the fire you thought you'd tamed ♪</i>

2224
03:04:46,541 --> 03:04:49,625
<i>♪ Now I'm burning through your gates ♪</i>

2225
03:05:08,625 --> 03:05:11,666
<i>♪ Came to show you your place ♪</i>

2226
03:05:11,749 --> 03:05:18,103
